<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 13.71 to 7942.03.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.24 to 479.66.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.11.</p>
<p>Advances beat declines 1516 to 1258.</p>
<p>Volume was 530,469,530 compared with 587,214,790 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730)) 538976288</p>
